  "Flickr:53766352352 — Jeep JL Conversion Adapters": {
    "source": {
      "title": "Flickr:53766352352 — Jeep JL Conversion Adapters",
      "provider": "Flickr",
      "page": "https://www.flickr.com/photos/spidertrax/53766352352/",
      "original": "https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53766352352_aeb88ed5dd_o.jpg",
      "width": 4701,
      "height": 3133,
      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/",
      "author": "Spidertrax Off-Road",
      "description": "Wouldn’t it be nice to open up wheel options from different vehicles? Spidertrax 1-1/2&quot; thick, 5 on 4.5&quot; to 5 on 5&quot;, 6061T6 aluminum adapters make it possible to change your wheel bolt pattern. Simply install on a Jeep XJ, YJ, TJ, ZJ, or Liberty axle and this adapter will convert your bolt pattern to the Jeep JL bolt circle.\n\nEach kit comes complete with 2 wheel adapters, 10 M14x1.5 Grade 8+ 4140 wheel studs (pre-installed), 10 1/2-20 lug nuts, and a package of thread locker. Each wheel adapter is anodized in blue, using a double anodizing process for twice the corrosion resistance. In addition, each wheel adapter is wheel and hub centric for a perfect fit.\n\nProudly made in the USA.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.spidertrax.com/whs035\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">www.spidertrax.com/whs035</a>",
      "restrictions": ""
    },
